msgid "%s — %d example(s)"
msgstr "%s — %d 个示例"

#: umain.rsbordermapnotshipped
#, object-pascal-format
msgid "This example needs the map %s, which the demo does not include. Borders between countries are disputed, and some places require published maps to be reviewed, so neither TyControls nor this demo ships a map that draws them. To see the example, save a GeoJSON file under the map's name in %s (for instance china.json), or register one in code with TyChartRegisterMap. Natural Earth (naturalearthdata.com) offers public-domain country data."
msgstr "这个示例要用地图 %s，demo 没有附带。各国对边界的画法有争议，一些地区还要求公开的地图先经审核，所以 TyControls 和这个 demo 都不附带画国界的地图。要看这个示例，把一份 GeoJSON 以地图名存进 %s（例如 china.json），或者在代码里用 TyChartRegisterMap 注册。在中国大陆向社会公开的地图，依据《测绘法》第三十八条和《地图管理条例》第十五条须报送审核、取得审图号，国界、台湾、南海诸岛等的表示须符合《地图管理条例》第八条与国家有关规定；面向大陆用户请使用天地图等带审图号的数据。大陆以外可以用 Natural Earth（naturalearthdata.com）等公共领域数据。"

#: umain.rsnogallery
msgid "The gallery was not found. Run tools/advchart-gallery/harvest.js to build examples/advchart/gallery."
msgstr "没有找到示例语料。运行 tools/advchart-gallery/harvest.js 生成 examples/advchart/gallery。"

#: umain.rsnotconverted
#, object-pascal-format
msgid "Not converted: %s"
msgstr "未转换：%s"

#: umain.rspickone
msgid "Pick an example on the left."
msgstr "在左边挑一个示例。"

#: umain.rssavedto
#, object-pascal-format
msgid "Saved to %s"
msgstr "已保存到 %s"
